description: Follow PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE.md for all backend work
alwaysApply: true
---

This backend is a modular monolith. Before changing architecture, read PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE.md.

Non-negotiable:
- PostgreSQL is the financial source of truth. Redis is not.
- Controllers stay thin. Business rules live in services. Database access lives in repositories.
- AI only returns structured commands. It never writes to the database.
- Free chat uses the rule-based parser. LLM parsing is Premium (`FEATURE.AI_NATURAL_LANGUAGE`).
- Never trust client-supplied user IDs. Scope every query by the authenticated user.
- Never use JavaScript numbers for money. Use Decimal helpers.
- Financial multi-write operations must be atomic.
- Telegram/LLM/payment SDKs stay under integrations/, not in domain services.
- Do not add microservices, bank sync, or Mini App work unless asked.
